    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "The learner has factored correctly. The next step is to identify the critical values where each factor is zero, then reason about where the product is positive. Ask only for the critical values first so the learner can take the next step. [TOOL CHECK: calculator(expression=\"5 + (-2)\") -> 3]",
